OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal after biker dies in
OL,4,AHighlands crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,7,Fafter a biker died in a crash on the
OL,8,FA862 near Dingwall in the Highlands.
OL,10,FThe crash was reported shortly after
OL,11,F16:00 on Monday and involved a BMW
OL,12,FGS1250 motorcycle and a silver
OL,13,FVolkswagen Passat.
OL,15,FThe 59-year-old male rider was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene. There
OL,17,Fwere no other injuries.
OL,19,FThe road near Ardullie was closed while
OL,20,Finquiries were carried out and
OL,21,Fre-opened at about 21:50.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
